        "q1":{"type":"question","settings":{"question":"Are the stated dimensions including the terminals?","answer":"<p>No. The 260 x 170 x 212mm dimensions are stated without the terminals. Allow extra clearance for terminal hardware, cable lugs and protective covers.</p>"}},
